WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:15,740
Also, would wheatgrass shots be of any value to my daily routine?

00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:26,860
Well, wheatgrass shots have been counted as big health benefits

00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:34,380
from a lot of people over the years, and it could give you a boost of energy. It has

00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:43,180
nutrients in it and things. The only negative to wheatgrass shots would be the possibility of gluten

00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:55,820
in them. Now, it's been studied that wheatgrass, if cut at an early stage, I think it's less than

00:00:55,820 --> 00:01:02,620
10 to 12 days of growth than it doesn't have gluten, and after that it does have gluten. So if you

00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:08,140
have a gluten sensitivity, you're staying away from gluten for some reason, you just have to be aware

00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:14,700
of that. So if you're getting wheatgrass at the grocery store or something, you don't know how

00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:19,580
all this is how long it's been since it was cut if you're growing your own wheatgrass, that would be

00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:24,860
a different scenario where you can keep track of that. If you don't have any gluten sensitivity,

00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:31,180
you're not staying away from gluten for any other reason, then that's not something you need to worry about.

00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:40,780
Wheatgrass shots in general, you can buy wheatgrass shots, I think, to add to your smoothies and

00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:49,740
things like that tend to be fairly expensive per shot. I have never added them to mine, and I haven't

00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:58,220
seen a benefit to do so. But it's the only thing that I'd be aware that I would be careful about is

00:01:58,220 --> 00:02:07,340
gluten if you have a gluten sensitivity.

